OL,3,AWhat happened in the failed execution
OL,4,Aof Christa Pike - and what next?
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS convicted murderer Christa Pike is
OL,7,Fin hospital and being given
OL,8,F"life-saving measures" after Tennessee
OL,9,Fauthorities failed in their attempt to
OL,10,Fexecute her by lethal injection.
OL,12,FThe case of Pike, whose attempted
OL,13,Fexecution had already been the subject
OL,14,Fof a high-profile legal battle, has
OL,15,Fraised a number of questions.
OL,17,FThese include what went wrong, what
OL,18,Fhappens next, and - for opponents of
OL,19,Fthe death penalty - fresh concerns
OL,20,Faround the suffering of an inmate when
OL,21,Fan execution does not go to plan.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
