OL,3,ARussian dissident Garry Kasparov says
OL,4,AUS warned him of danger to his life
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis comments come after the US Justice
OL,7,FDepartment unsealed an indictment
OL,8,Fearlier this month charging five people
OL,9,Fwho allegedly work for a network linked
OL,10,Fto the Kremlin with plotting attacks
OL,11,Fand murders in countries including the
OL,12,FUS, focusing on Russian dissidents and
OL,13,Fdefectors.
OL,15,FKasparov wrote in his publication The
OL,16,FNext Move that he had not been told
OL,17,Fexplicitly that he and fellow Free
OL,18,FRussia Forum co-founder Ivan Tyutrin
OL,19,Fwere considered targets, but said both
OL,20,Fhad been warned about their safety.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
